ildless, therefore he adopted Puruvanshi Dushmantha.\nThe king, Dushmanta, wanted his kingdom back, therefore he returned to his ancestral home. Among the four sons of Yadu, Sahasrara was the eldest. His son's name was Shatajit. He had three sons"
