ame famous according to the names of their respective\nkings. From the body, a son named Khalapana was born, from whom Diviratha originated. Suto Dharmaratho yasya jagrhe chitraratho aprajah. Rome Pad, thus known, to him, Dasharatha, friend. 7>. Shanta, ask your daughter to bring the Shringa."
